P-S1, run 23 September 2026 against uccixoonmbhrnyczyigt through
`mcp__Supabase__apply_migration`. The probe ends in a deliberate `raise
exception`, so the transaction rolls back; the rollback was verified afterwards
by `select count(*) from public.price_check_shares` (0) and by checking that no
migration named `probe%` was recorded (0).

RUN 1, BEFORE `20260923094710`. FAILED on assertion 5:

  ERROR:  P0001: created_by IS READABLE BY anon: a card would name whoever made it

  That is the finding this probe existed for. `20260922222524` had granted
  `select on table` to anon and authenticated, and `20260923094423` then laid a
  column list on top of it, which narrows nothing: a table privilege already
  covers every column. So a stranger holding a share id could read the uuid of
  whoever minted it, and anybody at all could page the table and collect the
  pairs. It also showed that `20260923094423`'s opening premise ("no table
  grant to anybody") was wrong: the empty answer from
  `information_schema.role_table_grants` was a fact about the read-only role
  doing the asking, not about the table. `20260923094710` corrects both.

RUN 2, AFTER `20260923094710`. PASSED:

  PROBE PASSED, ROLLING BACK.
   1 enum: (area,area_and_type) - no value for a property
   2 columns: no address, latitude, longitude, lat, lng or listing_id
   3 writer: no address, point or listing parameter
   4 anon read: Lekki Phase 1, 3 bed, 750000000 to 900000000 kobo, from 9 listings
   5 anon created_by: refused, so a card never names who made it
   6a anon insert: refused
   6b anon delete: refused
   6c anon update: refused
   7a "14 Admiralty Way": refused by the address guard
   7b "Victoria Island": accepted, so the guard has not eaten real neighbourhoods

WHAT 4 PROVES THAT NO UNIT TEST CAN. The figures came back as a real row read
through the `anon` role, which is the role a stranger following a share link
actually holds. Before this run nothing in the product had ever read this table,
so "the share surface returns nothing" and "the share surface is not wired up"
were indistinguishable from outside.

